        <p>This research project aims to develop and evaluate a comprehensive model that integrates advanced assistive technologies with community-based support systems to improve the quality of life for individuals with disabilities. Drawing inspiration from the innovative concepts found in the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atlantis" target="_blank">Atlantis</a> mythos—symbolizing a utopian vision of human potential—the project will explore how a harmonious blend of technology, policy, and social inclusion can foster greater independence and well-being.</p>
